@startuml isOperationOfFcPortType
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
isOperationOfFcPortType – Check if Operation has Specified Port Direction
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "FcPort" as fcPortRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json " as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor

  - forwardingConstruct 
  - operationUuid
  - portDirection (INPUT, OUTPUT, MANAGEMENT)
end note

requestor -> fcPortRes: (forwardingConstruct, operationUuid, portDirection)
activate fcPortRes

fcPortRes -> jd: read ForwardingConstruct
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve complete LTP
jd --> fcPortRes: fc-port list
deactivate jd

note over fcPortRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through fc-port entries in forwardingConstruct  
  - Check if fc-port's operation UUID matches operationUuid  
  - Check if fc-port's port-direction matches input portDirection  
  - Return true if both match  
  - Return false if no match exists
end note

fcPortRes --> requestor: Boolean (true | false)
deactivate fcPortRes

@enduml
